        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion E R2, Sonoma Entry Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion Hardware's Sonoma Keyed Entry Plate a simple design that is only made better by the additon of one of Fusion's Sonoma Collection knobs or levers. It is made out of solid brass and is available in either a medium bronze or oil rubbed bronze finish. It will fit all standard 5-1/2 inch on center door borings.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/large-sonoma-plate-fusion-r2\"><b>Large Sonoma Leverset</b></a> and <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/sonoma-entry-plate-fusion-e-r2-295864\"><b>More Trim Choices</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Sonoma Entry Set Fusion R2\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump Resistant Cylinder</li> \r\n<li>Solid Brass SC1 Keyway and 5 Pin System with Self Lubricating Solid Brass Plug & Housing</li>\r\n<li>High security strike</li> \r\n<li> Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation</li>\r\n<li>Matching Latch, Strike and screws for excellent appearance</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used</li>\r\n<li>Dual Spring Assist - to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rustic Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> This is a non-functional piece for looks only used to match trim for inactive door. It does not latch and it does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sonoma Entry Plate, Fusion E-R2",
                "description": "Fusion E-R2 Entry Plate -  Fusion Hardware's Sonoma Keyed Entry Plate a simple design that is only made better by the additon of one of Fusion's Sonoma Collection knobs or levers. It is made out of solid brass and is available in either a medium bronze or oil rubbed bronze finish. It will fit all standard 5-1/2 inch on center door borings.",
